, "id": "2241403899987839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_2241403903321172_3170098705087864465_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-lDWsXLvLdEQ7kNvwGZgNiX&_nc_oc=Adr9l-K9YM_COM7vBpp-myrDBOx2-u8G98u9kuaT-E9i9aPpXsemQSK-PPYZlyWii_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0F5RTRLzmIUo7KxIoHxCqdpdyi2s1tNehMcHityLFZw&oe=6B0858AF"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1652871712929572", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1652871719596238_1954979673295351500_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_8w2Rp_PNCsQ7kNvwGKA9x2&_nc_oc=AdpvkqvCSA0mpzy7XGztHd7VdGsa00XH6JZuzBu1xHwTdhkYWg95Jb7L9L_oopwve6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT24sGhgusuodMmjG2viPqhdxq6JYs4F1m3m1OE9UIGdQ&oe=6B086CBA"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1590201829168621", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_1590201832501954_3910930143941112256_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PmXiy0k3sfcQ7kNvwEd8psB&_nc_oc=AdqDRDunzbrLsAmQzZERQLNzcRcAsL8nnj65mslEMciBVevvwif1OtsHM05j3HVNUek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8zb2AWU4Q3SBK1n_1vQjRV8hA_gHtTt-_hFO8QNeqVA&oe=6B086091"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1106120971767369", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1106120975100702_8262311673365068041_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zHcijGPvU6kQ7kNvwENe6HM&_nc_oc=Adq0yQjX7LOQiDkqIUsWGJ4ETJzvmD1MFFDm_o5GRWKKLZVTVZBjMILQMfkz0OHqWXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSIyB4FVktLxexGkjYDnPQ3oI0sNRxYI4LKdmmOQAlcVw&oe=6B086345"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vista Pictures VR", "keywords": ["viewer", "model", "photos", "HDRI", "blender"], "long_description": "Vista Pictures VR is a viewer built for the way you actually use a headset.\n\nSEE EVERYTHING YOU OWN\n\nPhotos, 3D models, 360 HDRI environments and material textures, all in one browser. Images in JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIF and more. Models in GLB, glTF, STL, OBJ, PLY and 3MF. HDRI skies in Radiance and OpenEXR, up to 16K.\n\nTURN ANY PHOTO INTO 3D\n\nOpen a flat photo and see it in real stereo depth. The depth model runs on the headset itself, nothing is uploaded, and each result is kept, so the second look is instant.\n\nSTEP INSIDE\n\nStand inside a 360 sky, orbit a model at any scale and see it lit by the environment around it. Key light, ambient, reflections and shadows on real sliders. Dress a model in glass, metal, marble or wood. Passthrough on an opacity slider, so your room shows through.\n\nNEW: BLENDER BRIDGE\n\nPress START on the home screen and our free Blender add-on sends your scene to the headset in one click: materials, lights, cameras, animation and the World sky. Save again and the new version replaces the one you are looking at.\n\nBRING IN MORE\n\nSearch Poly Haven from inside the app and download free, public domain skies, models and textures at the resolution you choose. Or drop files from your PC browser over Wi-Fi.\n\nREACH YOUR FILES\n\nHeadset storage, USB drives, SMB shares, Dropbox, Google Drive and OneDrive, with thumbnails cached in the background.\n\nQuestions or problems? Find us on Discord: https://discord.gg/Y8kVdFbKhX", "short_description": "Vista Pictures VR turns your Quest into a proper viewer for everything visual you own. View photos at full resolution, walk around 3D models and stand inside 360 HDRI skies. Open files from headset storage, a network share, your cloud drive or straight from your PC over Wi-Fi. Made it in Blender? Our free add-on sends the whole scene to the headset in one click. Search Poly Haven for free CC0 skies, models and textures without taking the headset off."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": 